Subject: [PATCH 0/2] Sensor support for the LG G8x ThinQ cameras

This adds camera sensor helpers and sensor properties for the three
sensors of the LG G8x ThinQ (Qualcomm SM8150): Sony IMX363 (main),
Samsung S5K3M3 (wide) and Samsung S5KGD1 (front). The kernel drivers for
the Samsung sensors and the SM8150 CAMSS support are being prepared for
linux-media; the work and test notes are at
https://github.com/gauravsuman007/nura-g8x.

With the helpers the simple pipeline's exposure loop settles within
about 8 frames on both rear cameras, instead of creeping for two
seconds (IMX363) or starting nearly black (S5K3M3).

These patches were written with the help of an AI coding assistant
(Claude Opus 5.5, Anthropic); I have reviewed and tested them.

Gaurav Suman (2):
